// Rule:        Event log clearing, including multi-channel bursts
// Tactics:     Defense Evasion
// Techniques:  T1070.001 (Clear Windows Event Logs)
// Source:      Sysmon EventID 1; pair with Security Event 1102 and System Event 104 where available
// Seen in:     Q8.2 and Q8.4 - two waves per host, 5 then 16 channels, all commands inside one second
// Severity:    High
// Tuning:      Forward logs to the SIEM so copies survive local clearing (that is what made this hunt possible).
HarborlightDental_CL
| where EventID == 1
| where CommandLine has "wevtutil" and CommandLine has " cl"
    or CommandLine has_any ("Clear-EventLog", "Remove-EventLog", "Limit-EventLog")
| summarize commands = count(), first_cmd = min(EventTime), last_cmd = max(EventTime) by host, Image, ParentImage, burst = bin(EventTime, 1m)
| where commands >= 3
